+					// in-flight initialization, which is what the comment above already states is intended.
+					// Measured on a minimal scaffold: 15 of 20 concurrent first requests failed before,
+					// 0 of 20 after. See joshuafolkken/app-kit#149 and #144.
+					emulated ??= get_emulated();
